# `COPY . .` in the build stage copies over the node_modules the deps stage
# installed for Linux — with whatever the host happened to have, which on a
# macOS or Windows checkout is a different platform's binaries for the same
# paths. The image then fails at run time in a way that points nowhere near
# the cause. .next is stale build output and .env.local is the developer's.
node_modules/
.next/
out/

.env
.env.*

.git/
.gitignore
npm-debug.log*
